    "text": "LIVE\nSpaceX Prices IPO at $135 Per Share\nFollow live news and analysis ahead of the company's public trading debut.\nLast Updated:\nJune 11, 2026 at 4:33 PM ET\nShooting for the Stars\nSpaceX's public debut is nearly here.\nThe Elon Musk-founded space company that pioneered reusable rockets will start trading on Friday after pricing its record-setting IPO, which valued the company at about $1.8 trillion.\nIt is the largest IPO ever, minting Musk as a trillionaire, with a sky-high valuations built on the goal of putting AI computing in orbit.",
